# Frontend Rules

## Stack

| Concern | Tool |
|---------|------|
| Package manager | Bun |
| Language | TypeScript (strict) |
| Styling | Tailwind CSS |
| Components | Shadcn UI |
| Icons | Lucide |

## Design Philosophy

- Mobile-first, minimalist, modern SaaS
- Conversion-focused — clear hierarchy, minimal friction
- Composition over inheritance
- Components under 200 lines; extract reusable logic into hooks

## Sub-rules

Load the relevant file when working in that area:

| Rule | Covers |
|------|--------|
| [casing.md](casing.md) | File, component, function, hook, type naming |
| [files-structure.md](files-structure.md) | Directory layout, component co-location |
