## Always avoid

- `any` in TypeScript
- Class components
- `<div>`/`<span>` with click handlers — use `<button>` or `<a>`
- `outline-none` without a focus-visible replacement
- `transition: all` — list properties explicitly
- Inline styles when Tailwind class exists
- Context for data that belongs in a store
- `TODO` comments in committed code
